{"4645760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "How Much for the Body in the Freezer", "steam_appid": 4645760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645760/extras/0f540847b684d8cdcca6485514689ab7.webp?t=1781020209\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How Much for the Body in the Freezer is a short visual novel about...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...about what, exactly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645760/extras/d27078080bff86be9d4badd7b47606f8.webp?t=1781020209\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normally, this is where I’m supposed to build up your expectations.<br>This is the store description page, after all, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know, that familiar nightlife district, the corpse in the freezer, the cute girl.<br>Just line them up, follow the thread, and keep writing from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone’s happy.<br>Clap, clap, clap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645760/extras/fdc5177be4925cf6d6087a8033cad45d.webp?t=1781020209\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I can’t do that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because this story is far too ordinary.<br>So ordinary that even I can’t stand it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If I told you this was a thrilling suspense story, packed with one climax after another, then by the time you reached the end, you would probably... well...<br>Maybe you wouldn’t be furious, but you’d at least be disappointed, wouldn’t you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ah.<br>Without meaning to, I’ve gone and written another thing I don’t know how to recommend to anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645760/extras/026c5394024db63baf824c947970bedd.webp?t=1781020209\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, in this life of mine—not long, but not exactly short either—I’ve learned a little about this thing called “expectation.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, coming to a certain street with a certain impression, a certain expectation,<br>only to find it isn’t what you imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, quietly beginning to expect something from another person,<br>only to find they aren’t what you imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the world itself,<br>and finding it isn’t what you imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645760/extras/31189d7a3ad4a77fe21b0978fe75a254.webp?t=1781020209\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So I can’t build up your expectations here.<br>That wouldn’t match what this story is about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just an ordinary story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645760/extras/9223877bc62c697b654170ec8800f674.webp?t=1781020209\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that hopes, quietly, that someone out there might like it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645760/extras/0f540847b684d8cdcca6485514689ab7.webp?t=1781020209\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How Much for the Body in the Freezer is a short visual novel about...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...about what, exactly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645760/extras/d27078080bff86be9d4badd7b47606f8.webp?t=1781020209\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normally, this is where I’m supposed to build up your expectations.<br>This is the store description page, after all, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know, that familiar nightlife district, the corpse in the freezer, the cute girl.<br>Just line them up, follow the thread, and keep writing from there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone’s happy.<br>Clap, clap, clap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645760/extras/fdc5177be4925cf6d6087a8033cad45d.webp?t=1781020209\" width=600 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I can’t do that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because this story is far too ordinary.<br>So ordinary that even I can’t stand it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If I told you this was a thrilling suspense story, packed with one climax after another, then by the time you reached the end, you would probably... well...<br>Maybe you wouldn’t be furious, but you’d at least be disappointed, wouldn’t you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ah.<br>Without meaning to, I’ve gone and written another thing I don’t know how to recommend to anyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4645760/extras/